{"resourceIdentifier":"4403","resourceName":"CEKEREK BIOGAS POWER PLANT","description":"CEKEREK BIOGAS POWER PLANT (hereafter referred to as the Project) is a greenfield biogas-to-energy project that aims to methane capture through anaerobic digestion and utilization of methane for thermal energy and electricity generation via cogeneration units. The cattle and animal manure as the main feedstock is collected from the neighboring farms with special trucks and transferred to the plant. Continuously Stirred Tank Reactor (CSTR) type anaerobic digesters are used to capture methane-rich biogas. Waste heat from gas engines is utilized mainly for heating anaerobic fermenters. The generated electricity is not only supplied to the national grid but also used for auxiliary/internal consumption required for the plant to function. \r\nThe project is being implemented by ÇEKEREK ENERJİ VE GÜBRE ÜRETİM A.Ş., the Project Owner, in Çekerek district, Yozgat province, in Turkey. The start date of the project and of the first crediting period is determined as June 29th, 2021.\r\nThe project activity avoids methane emission through the above-mentioned capture and utilization processes. Furthermore, the project reduces CO2 emissions from fossil-fuel-based electricity generation by supplying biogas-based electricity to the national grid. \r\nThe project adopts the renewable crediting period of 7 years, twice renewable for a total of 21 years. The estimated average net annual emission reductions are 50,727 tCO2e/yr. Accordingly, the project is expected to generate 285,369 tCO2e emissions reduction during the first crediting period.","location":{"latitude":40.062200,"longitude":35.542590},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-06-29","endExclusive":"2023-07-30","endInclusive":"2023-07-29"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4403"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"YOZGAT"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"27340"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.D.,AMS-III.D."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Ruby Canyon Engineering, Inc"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"26/05/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 07/12/2021 - 06/12/2028"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=92971&IDKEY=mlksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098m128207009","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_PCP_4403_24Apr2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-06-29T00:19:22.9Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=89191&IDKEY=0lksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098w122994389","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Cekerek_Listing_Representation_230322.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-04-28T11:38:04.56Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=132311&IDKEY=f097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87k182456869","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS-CL'ekerek Biogas Power Plant(ID4403)-PD.pdf","uploadDate":"2025-05-26T11:25:50.07Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=111835&IDKEY=9kjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj9